time, which I do remember,

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:21.150
which was Dirty Dancing.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.128
- And then that's that.

00:06:23.128 --> 00:06:26.140
- You know, we made a
bunch of other movies,

00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:27.311
there were some that did very well --

00:06:27.311 --> 00:06:28.144
- Ghoulies.

00:06:28.144 --> 00:06:29.750
I remember this is how the
conversation went down.

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:31.017
No, no, you made Ghoulies.

00:06:31.017 --> 00:06:32.600
