but also entrepreneurial.

00:07:25.859 --> 00:07:27.800
And I sort of surveyed the landscape.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.000
And this is in 1993, and I said,

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.410
you know I think video games are gonna

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:33.541
become a huge entertainment business.

00:07:33.541 --> 00:07:35.904
And I went to a company
called Crystal Dynamics

00:07:35.904 --> 00:07:38.560
which was a pre-revenue video game company

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:41.217
as the first CEO, built that company up.

00:07:41.217 --> 00:07:44.440
And then after we'd sort of got it

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.010
to a critical mass, I left to do

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:47.710
