that wasn't an oxymoron.

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:52.520
That was called DMG, that went super well.

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:56.417
Took it from last place
to nearly first place.

00:07:56.417 --> 00:07:59.930
Would have been first place,
but one and two merged.

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.850
So we were second place, but you know

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:03.170
it was a great result we had a lot

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:04.790
of great hits and turned around

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.720
the RCA label and other things.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:08.350
And then I revised my goals once again

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:10.080
and said okay, my goal now is to run

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:13.010
a diversified media
company that's supercharged

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:14.770
