space, but nonetheless.

00:34:57.370 --> 00:34:59.900
- So I think you know,
it's always been hard

00:34:59.900 --> 00:35:01.900
to build a business
that's highly successful.

00:35:01.900 --> 00:35:03.250
It's still hard today.

